
### 🔹 Crear `.gitignore` (CRÍTICO - Copia Esto)
```gitignore
# ================= Python =================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# ================= Entorno Virtual =================
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# ================= IDE =================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ================= Secrets y Config =================
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.key
*.pem

# ================= Docker =================
!.dockerignore
docker-compose.override.yml

# ================= Uploads y Datos =================
uploads/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.mov
*.webm
*.mp3
*.log

# ================= Base de Datos =================
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ================= Frontend Build =================
frontend/dist/
frontend/node_modules/

# ================= Documentación =================
doc/_build/
*.pdf